{"3977920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barge", "steam_appid": 3977920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Barge you become the owner of a river barge floating down and endless river. Build your barge larger to grow more crops and raise more animals to produce more products you can sell in the towns you pass along the river. Dive underwater to explore the river bottom where you will find sunken treasures, dangerous but rewarding caves, and various resources. In the towns you pass along the river you can sell your products, or purchase resources you need for your barge. You can also visit shops that will process some of your resources for you, such as a lumber mill to turn your logs into planks and a blacksmith to use the ore you find to upgrade your tools.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Barge you become the owner of a river barge floating down and endless river. Build your barge larger to grow more crops and raise more animals to produce more products you can sell in the towns you pass along the river. Dive underwater to explore the river bottom where you will find sunken treasures, dangerous but rewarding caves, and various resources. In the towns you pass along the river you can sell your products, or purchase resources you need for your barge. You can also visit shops that will process some of your resources for you, such as a lumber mill to turn your logs into planks and a blacksmith to use the ore you find to upgrade your tools.</p>", "short_description": "Grow crops, raise animals, and harvest resources that you can sell in towns you pass as you and your barge float down an endless river in this top down, pixel art, farming sim.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977920/6289c03b3e124ffa7a0bf4d1236384dfd58cc384/header.jpg?t=1780348362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akam